From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 11:59:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] rounded tiles, buttons and poster art

Rounded-corner look: a lists/rounded-tile.png focus/background texture
for the settings home panel (resized to 5 x 350px tiles), settings
category and skin settings lists; rounded button-fo/dialogbutton-fo; and
diffuse masks (media/masks/*) that round poster art in the List, Poster,
Shift and InfoWall views and the video info dialog, with new shadows.
